  and let $R_1, \dots, R_k$ be $k$ open regions of $\mathbb{R}^d$, where $|x - y| < 2$
  for any $x, y$ that lie in the same region $R_i$. Then the number of linear
  combinations $\sum_{i=1}^{n} \epsilon_i a_i$, $\epsilon_i \in \{1, -1\}$,
